{"id":"9a1432082607876a","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-predicate-logic.md","title":"Finite Classical First-Order Derivations","display":"df-predicate-logic — Finite Classical First-Order Derivations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-predicate-logic","aliases":["67-df-predicate-logic"],"display":"df-predicate-logic — Finite Classical First-Order Derivations","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-predicate-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-predicate-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicate-logic — Finite Classical First-Order Derivations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；非逻辑公理均为句子，因此从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 使用全称化无需开放假设的附加限制。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;|s|\">\\(i&lt;|s|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n,N(P),C(P,Q)\">\\(p_n,N(P),C(P,Q)\\)</span> 是互不相交的带标签命题树构造；下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_v\">\\(V_v\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Phi\">\\(R_\\Phi\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a> 的无捕获代入；等号替换公理对任意公式适用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}\">\\(\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\)</span> 在下式定义，结论允许开放公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 无语言下标时仅缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\np_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&amp;N(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&amp;C(P,Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;Y_{j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Y_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in Y_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in Y_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_jY_j,\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq v(n),&amp;V_v(N(P))&amp;\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&amp;V_v(C(P,Q))&amp;\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&amp;R_\\Phi(N(P))&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&amp;R_\\Phi(C(P,Q))&amp;\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\np_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&amp;N(P)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&amp;C(P,Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&amp;Y_{j+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Y_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in Y_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in Y_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_jY_j,\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq v(n),&amp;V_v(N(P))&amp;\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&amp;V_v(C(P,Q))&amp;\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&amp;R_\\Phi(N(P))&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&amp;R_\\Phi(C(P,Q))&amp;\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Taut}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ V_v(P)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R_\\Phi(P):P\\in\\mathrm{Taut}\\land\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{\\mathbb N}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi\\to\\varphi[t/x]:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\psi):x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=u\\to(\\varphi[t/x]\\to\\varphi[u/x]):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|s|\\land\n\\bigl[s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n0&lt;|s|\\land s_{|s|-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ \\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Taut}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ V_v(P)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{R_\\Phi(P):P\\in\\mathrm{Taut}\\land\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{\\mathbb N}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi\\to\\varphi[t/x]:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\psi):x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=u\\to(\\varphi[t/x]\\to\\varphi[u/x]):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|s|\\land\n\\bigl[s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n0&lt;|s|\\land s_{|s|-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i&lt;|s|\\ \\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明的公理行必须是句子，但逻辑行和中间推导可以有自由变量。命题语法在本条直接给出，从而不依赖以可推导性定义的独立类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi[t/x]$ 采用 [[67-df-formula]] 的无捕获代入；等号替换公理对任意公式适用。$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}$、$\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}$ 和 $\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 在下式定义，结论允许开放公式。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}$ 无语言下标时仅缩写 $\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}$；$L_A$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetic-language]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i<|s|","display":false},{"tex":"p_n,N(P),C(P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"V_v","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\np_n&\\coloneqq\\langle0,n\\rangle,&N(P)&\\coloneqq\\langle1,P\\rangle,&C(P,Q)&\\coloneqq\\langle2,P,Q\\rangle,\\\\\nY_0&\\coloneqq\\{p_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},&Y_{j+1}&\\coloneqq Y_j\\cup\\{N(P):P\\in Y_j\\}\\cup\\{C(P,Q):P,Q\\in Y_j\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prop}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_jY_j,\\\\\nV_v(p_n)&\\coloneqq v(n),&V_v(N(P))&\\coloneqq1-V_v(P),&V_v(C(P,Q))&\\coloneqq V_v(P)V_v(Q),\\\\\nR_\\Phi(p_n)&\\coloneqq\\Phi(n),&R_\\Phi(N(P))&\\coloneqq\\neg R_\\Phi(P),&R_\\Phi(C(P,Q))&\\coloneqq R_\\Phi(P)\\land R_\\Phi(Q).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Taut}&\\coloneqq\\{P\\in\\mathrm{Prop}:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\ V_v(P)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_L&\\coloneqq\\{R_\\Phi(P):P\\in\\mathrm{Taut}\\land\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{\\mathbb N}\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi\\to\\varphi[t/x]:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\psi):x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_L(\\varphi)\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{t=u\\to(\\varphi[t/x]\\to\\varphi[u/x]):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i)&\\Longleftrightarrow i<|s|\\land\n\\bigl[s_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{LogAx}_L\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists j,k<i\\ (s_k=(s_j\\to s_i))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor\\exists j<i\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_L\\ (s_i=\\forall x s_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n0<|s|\\land s_{|s|-1}=\\varphi\\land\\forall i<|s|\\ \\operatorname{LocalLine}_{T,L}(s,i),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L^{<\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{PLProof}_{L,T}(s,\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L_A}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3292,"backlinks":[{"id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{fcode}_\\Lambda(F)$ 是先按 $g_\\Lambda$ 递增排列有限集合 $F$ 再编码所得的数；$\\operatorname{enc}$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]。$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]，$\\bot=\\neg(0=0)$。"},{"id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Seq},\\operatorname{Len},(p)_i$ 取 [[67-df-sequence]]，$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]] 的算术语言实例；这里空公理集的局部规则只有逻辑公理、MP 和全称化。"},{"id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为有限有效一阶语言，$g_L=c_L$ 取 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]。$\\mathrm{LogAx}_L$、$\\operatorname{LocalLine}_{\\varnothing,L}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]；$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]，不使用语言 $L$ 中未声明的常元。"},{"id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g_L=c_L$ 取 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{NormCode}_L$ 的程序元数和非法码分支均列于 Assertion。$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]；不从候选翻译 $t$ 的存在反推规范化前提。"},{"id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-predicate-logic]] 的经典一阶有限证明演算。本条以 $\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 标记该演算的推导关系，用 $\\vdash$ 表示省略演算下标的元语言记号。"},{"id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定完整的经典一阶有限证明演算 $\\mathrm{PL}$，$A\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\varphi$ 对任意公理集合 A 表示存在有限正式推导；演算关系取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]，此处不要求 A 有效公理化。"},{"id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g=c_{L_A}$，另固定 $e_\\nu\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1$，满足 $⟦ e_\\nu⟧(g(\\varphi))=g(\\nu\\varphi)$（$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}$），非法公式码取 $0$。$\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)$ 是显式前提；$\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}$ 取 [[67-df-predicate-logic]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-predicate-logic]] — Finite Classical First-Order Derivations。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-predicate-logic]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-predicate-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","854772391cef4007","97e929795d778cd6"]}